<!--Post: 1638--><!--Time: 1102483307-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1638"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 07, 2004 - 9:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TOM &amp; Everyone: This site is great &amp; I have an idea: What if we organized a 5-day &#34;CATCH BTK&#34; trip to Wichita? The aim of course would be to lead to a solution of the case. It would contain a BTK tour of the known murder scenes, places he left victims&#39; cars, letter-drops, etc. We could rent a mini-van once there &amp; travel / live fairly cheaply! Finding low air-fare would be the biggest challenge. <BR>Of course it would be rather spooky, but that might be part of the attraction....  <BR>Just a thought. What do you think?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1638-->
<!--Post: 1745--><!--Time: 1102755532-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1745"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 12:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Allright, it&#39;s obvious you&#39;re all chicken. It tunrs out I can get Very cheap airfare to and from Kansas.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1745-->
<!--Post: 1746--><!--Time: 1102773821-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1746"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 6:03 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think that it is a good idea. I am envious of those who live in Wichita as they have history and info at their disposal and a possible glimpse of BTK. <BR> <BR>I had an ESP revelation that BTK&#39;s homeground is Coffeyville. Take that for its psychotic worth! It is easier to be an upstanding citizen in a small town. Of course, people are nosier as well. Gossip travels quickly.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1746-->
<!--Post: 1749--><!--Time: 1102792526-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1749"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 11:15 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yeah, Teardrop, the Wichita locals have an advantage. But by the same token, they&#39;ve had to live with that nightmare all these years. <BR> <BR>I think a few-day trip there by several of us would be a really fascinating adventure. And maybe lead to some excellent tips. Let&#39;s see if anyone else is interested in exploring this...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1749-->
<!--Post: 1760--><!--Time: 1102817915-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1760"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Krista<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Krista<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 6:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Vscantu, <BR> <BR>Count me in and a few other of us here from Texas. <BR> <BR>I&#39;m ready! <BR>Krista<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1760-->
<!--Post: 1761--><!--Time: 1102818477-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1761"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Krista<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Krista<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 6:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe the first part of the year, after the Holidays.  I have a group of 3 right now, ready, willing and able.  I know that I can assemble a bigger group between now and then.  I can work on some of the details from here. Let me know your ideas, ie lodgeing, travel and such.  I can do investigation on this end via computer and a friend that I have met on this site that lives in Witchita. <BR> <BR>Kind Regards, <BR>Krista <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1761-->
<!--Post: 1764--><!--Time: 1102821033-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1764"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 7:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Please don&#39;t come before Spring Break. Winters are cold here. Unless you like being bundled up and freezing your face. lol <BR>-Deb<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1764-->
<!--Post: 1770--><!--Time: 1102825202-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1770"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:zodiacfiles@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Ed_neil<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ed_neil<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 8:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->After spring break when it warms up... sounds like a plan!  It&#39;s going to be expensive for us here in California: airfare, place to stay, etc, etc, etc.  Maybe we can charter a bus, it&#39;ll take maybe 30 hours to drive.  And a group rate at a hotel...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1770-->
<!--Post: 1776--><!--Time: 1102834371-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1776"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 10:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Great idea, Ed. A bus trip in the spring would be interesting, &amp; probably fun. Or maybe we can get some kinda WAY CHEAP group airfare discount that leaves from S.F. <BR> <BR>KRISTA: any ideas for us in the S.F. area?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1776-->
<!--Post: 1777--><!--Time: 1102834817-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1777"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 11:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I wonder if we can also get that guy that runs this site interested in this CATCHBTK trip.  <BR> <BR>What&#39;s his name again?? TOM, or something, I think.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1777-->
<!--Post: 1782--><!--Time: 1102837850-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1782"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 11:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Victor, it looks like I might just be headed to Wichita this month. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1782-->
<!--Post: 1790--><!--Time: 1102867785-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1790"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitagirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitagirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 12, 2004 - 8:09 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->krist glad to have u all<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1790-->
<!--Post: 1792--><!--Time: 1102869540-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1792"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 12, 2004 - 8:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It sounds like a good idea to me, keep us posted on when we are supposed to go! <BR> <BR>I look forward to it!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1792-->
<!--Post: 1793--><!--Time: 1102869914-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1793"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Krista<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Krista<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 12, 2004 - 8:45 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, <BR>Your in Oregon right?  When are you planning your trip, December or January?   <BR> <BR>Vscantu, let me look and see what we can do to get the West Coast over to Kansas and I&#39;ll let you know.   <BR> <BR>Wichitagirl, how many people would you be able to &#34;put up&#34; at your place? I know there are 3 in my group now. <BR>But, if we end up with a lot of people coming, maybe you could help us out with searching for some hotel/motel group rates there in Wichita. <BR> <BR>More later, <BR>Krista <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1793-->
<!--Post: 1795--><!--Time: 1102880101-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1795"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 12, 2004 - 11:35 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TOM: Wow, that&#39;s amazing you&#39;re going to Witchita so soon. What&#39;s the occassion, if you can say? It may be a good pre-cursor to our &#39;group&#39; CatchBTK trip in the spring &#40;if that&#39;s the best time for us&#41;. You may want to re-visit Witchita with us then. What do you think? The best would be if BLT is caught by then! <BR> <BR>KRISTA: Thanks for offering to do that searching on low airfares &#40;or busfares?&#41; for us in the S.F. area! Let&#39;s see how many of us we can interest from here. And other places also. I think the main thing is to keep the prices down low! <BR> <BR>If we take a bus, don&#39;t forget to take a deck of cards! &#40;lol&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1795-->
<!--Post: 1816--><!--Time: 1102926733-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1816"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:zodiacfiles@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Ed_neil<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ed_neil<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 13, 2004 - 12:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Make sure it&#39;s after March: I&#39;m going to the Grand Slam Sci Fi Summit that month.  When is Spring Break anyway?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1816-->
<!--Post: 1817--><!--Time: 1102927112-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1817"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 13, 2004 - 12:38 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Victor, I might be able to announce details of my trip soon, but not yet.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
